{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17107700","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17107700","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1710770001:1":{"text":"Forgive my surprise. Just a moment ago, this hall was empty. Can anyone explain where, exactly, you've been?","source_cn":"请原谅我的惊讶。但就在刚才，这座大厅还空无一人。可否请...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB3532B15F6B7526","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710770002:1":{"text":"Judging by your expressions, I take it you weren't enjoying a pleasant dinner...","source_cn":"看你们的神色，并非在享受一场美妙的晚宴啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE38A45EAE08BC66B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710770003:1":{"text":"Magister Cyran! Thank heavens you're here! ","source_cn":"迪尔格雷大人！您来得正好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6B8DD85A9E8AD79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710770004:1":{"text":"W-we went to the Hall of Ancients!","source_cn":"我们、我们去了圣古堂！那个消失的圣古堂！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3F5D5C9F5F29C32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710770005:1":{"text":"That's not all! There was a Hypofiend, too. The Mirror Wraith I've seen in history books!","source_cn":"不仅如此！还有……还有魔物！就是史书上的那个魔灵镜影！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC9EE2412B0E6F26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710770006:1":{"text":"But... Prince Orion...","source_cn":"但！但是王子殿下……奥利安殿下他……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBBE72B6EA9A370F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710770007:1":{"text":"His Highness the Prince is nothing short of a hero! He vanquished that dreadful monster entirely!","source_cn":"王子殿下是英雄！他、他把那个魔物打倒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x679B264115FCAB19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710770008:1":{"text":"Quite like King Rolan reborn, I daresay! And we were fortunate enough to witness every moment of it!","source_cn":"就像罗兰大帝一样！我们都亲眼看到了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16F0DC28A0AD76C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710770009:1":{"text":"Is that so? Such a miracle...","source_cn":"哦？竟有此等神迹……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74C780C8CBF3C0E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710770010:1":{"text":"Wait... If the monster was defeated and we're back...","source_cn":"……等等。既然魔物被打倒了，我们也都回来了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6C403E774828279","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710770011:1":{"text":"Where is His Highness?","source_cn":"王子殿下呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC68203EE23053C88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710770012:1":{"text":"Surely he's not still trapped in the chapel?! To save us?!","source_cn":"难道……殿下他为了救我们，还被困在那该死的教堂里？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2260848BDBDA5CBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1710770013:1":{"text":"This is a disaster! What do we do?!","source_cn":"这……这可如何是好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14C65680FA027199","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1710770014:1":{"text":"Magister Cyran. You are the Chief Court Mage. What's your assessment?","source_cn":"……迪尔格雷卿，你是宫廷首席法师。对此，你有什么看法？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFDDF06C00923F5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1710770015:1":{"text":"Everyone, stay calm. Recall everything you witnessed.","source_cn":"诸位，请冷静。请仔细回想你们所见证的一切。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2D26369D913C74F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1710770016:1":{"text":"What do you mean?","source_cn":"这……您的意思是？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x285EA063AEF4F962","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1710770017:1":{"text":"This was no disaster. It was a <style=\"highlight\">trial</style>, and you, my lords and ladies, you were chosen as witnesses.","source_cn":"这难道是一场灾难吗？不，这是一场<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFD6CD0A2E360A1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1710770018:1":{"text":"Prince Orion is not trapped. He has been <style=\"highlight\">chosen</style>. He defeated Hypofiends and protected his people. This is the path of kings, as Rolan once walked.","source_cn":"奥利安殿下并非被困住了。他是被<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BB2D71B63AE0874","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1710770019:1":{"text":"You returned safely because your role as witnesses was complete. As for the Prince remaining there...","source_cn":"你们平安归来，是因为你们的见证使命已经完成。而殿下之所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB57745AE1E9BCC70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1710770020:1":{"text":"Does that not suggest he awaits <style=\"highlight\">divine coronation</style> in that hall?","source_cn":"难道不是意味着，他正在那座神圣的殿堂里，等待接受<st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD6DFACEAE5A9CE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1710770021:1":{"text":"Coronation... you mean Excalibur?","source_cn":"接受加冕……你是说，石中剑？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1B652868FCAE3BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1710770022:1":{"text":"... Yes! A trial! And to think, we have been so fortunate as to be chosen to witness it with our own humble eyes! He is the destined one!","source_cn":"……没错！是试炼！一定是试炼！我们是被选中的见证者！奥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0352C1637B424974","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1710770023:1":{"text":"But when will His Highness return?","source_cn":"那殿下什么时候才能回来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70B20C3CD6F52541","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1710770024:1":{"text":"Do not worry. The Prince will return. And when he does, he will bring the Hall of Ancients with him, carrying Dura's glory!","source_cn":"无需担忧。王子殿下必将归来！而且，当他归来之时，他必将...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA3A748C1E7C0B8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1710770025:1":{"text":" The Empire... will witness a true miracle!","source_cn":"耀光……将迎来真正的神迹！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC2F1860076B7F78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1710770026:1":{"text":"This is truly destiny!","source_cn":"天命所归……这才是真正的天命所归啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC377BE9C8258BBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1710770027:1":{"text":"Everyone. There is no need to continue tonight's banquet.","source_cn":"诸位。今夜的宴会，已经没有继续的必要了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5FCCE4B0834E9B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1710770028:1":{"text":"Return and rest. Then, let us await Prince Orion's...","source_cn":"请先行回去休息，养足精神。然后……让我们一起静候奥利安...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE047EBCB6B3AE3F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1710770029:1":{"text":"...triumphant return.","source_cn":"……凯旋而归。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9E058EF15D7E1F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:迪尔格雷":{"text":"Cyran","source":"迪尔格雷","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:男爵葛朗台":{"text":"Baron Grandet","source":"男爵葛朗台","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:女公爵梦妮":{"text":"Duchess Monette","source":"女公爵梦妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伯爵坦尼斯":{"text":"Count Tannis","source":"伯爵坦尼斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:大臣康斯曼":{"text":"Minister Corsten","source":"大臣康斯曼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:亲王孔蒂":{"text":"Noble Conti","source":"亲王孔蒂","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":30,"localized_text_count":29,"speaker_count":6}}